You call upon an eerie night to aid you for [3, 4, 5, 7, 8 (TL1-5)] turns.

Each turn you automatically fire a beam of darkness towards a random foe (prioritizing the ones further away) that deals [102, 138, 165, 188, 209 (TL1-5; SP 100)] darkness damage and has 25% chance to blind any foes caught inside for 4 turns.

The damage will increase with your Spellpower.
